{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/extras/9781fe3cc5c3b16bd947ca9ff4173c6c.avif?t=1757698400\" width=600 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run Your Video Store</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the golden ages of video rentals by opening your very own video store. Rent, sell, organize and build your business from the ground up and revisit those beloved childhood memories!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/extras/be7d0aac2ab19f0c31cce079cd179d53.poster.avif?t=1757698400\" width=600 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/extras/be7d0aac2ab19f0c31cce079cd179d53.webm?t=1757698400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/extras/be7d0aac2ab19f0c31cce079cd179d53.mp4?t=1757698400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serve Your Customers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate the cash register, charge late fees, give movie recommendations or make your clients their favorite slushy. There are many things to do in a day's work when managing your store!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Store</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify the walls and floors, decorate with posters and memorabilia and expand the layout of your shop to create the ultimate rental destination. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/extras/ee023f041cad319e0346cb7e3dafb060.poster.avif?t=1757698400\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/extras/ee023f041cad319e0346cb7e3dafb060.webm?t=1757698400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/extras/ee023f041cad319e0346cb7e3dafb060.mp4?t=1757698400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Movies &amp; Games\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your shelves with thousands of unique VHS tapes and games, each with their own title, genre, cover art and rental statistics!\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Order Movies, Furniture &amp; More</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Browse the local furniture catalogue for different shelves or the coolest gumball machine, order newly released movies on your old PC or buy old classics directly from movie merchants and collectors. There are many ways to grow your inventory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional</strong>\u00a0<strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your returns:\u00a0 Add late fees in the system, rewind tapes and set aside reserved movies for your customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your movies: Place televisions in your store and play any movie you own!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolving Customer Interactions: Seasons, weather and holidays will affect gameplay and what your customers rent! Be ready, rainy Friday nights are crazy busy in the store!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your Inventory: Showcase rare movies in display cases, sell your doubles in bargain bins and keep your back store's inventory well organised.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share Movies with your friends: Every movie can be ordered on your PC with a unique code that you can share with your friends!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3552140?t=1757698400","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/13d4f7dd32c2f20b17b9bffc0bc388e1ec1a3c38/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757698400","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/f96fe51f6f2c1f9775108565bbf60d104c0fb9b8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757698400","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/f96fe51f6f2c1f9775108565bbf60d104c0fb9b8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757698400","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/extras/9781fe3cc5c3b16bd947ca9ff4173c6c.avif?t=1757698400\" width=600 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run Your Video Store</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the golden ages of video rentals by opening your very own video store. Rent, sell, organize and build your business from the ground up and revisit those beloved childhood memories!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati