nd rental statistics!\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Order Movies, Furniture &amp; More</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Browse the local furniture catalogue for different shelves or the coolest gumball machine, order newly released movies on your old PC or buy old classics directly from movie merchants and collectors. There are many ways to grow your inventory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional</strong>\u00a0<strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your returns:\u00a0 Add late fees in the system, rewind tapes and set aside reserved movies for your customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your movies: Place televisions in your store and play any movie you own!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolving Customer Interactions: Seasons, weather and holidays will affect gameplay and what your customers rent! Be ready, rainy Friday nights are crazy busy in the store!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your Inventory: Showcase rare movies in display cases, sell your doubles in bargain bins and keep your back store's inventory well organised.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share Movies with your friends: Every movie can be ordered on your PC with a unique code that you can share with your friends!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Blood Pact Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/17f1a9706d428bd46299d6067d6eebc48d24474f/header.jpg?t=1757698400","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul c